stance and name ESP)\n- **Team Check**: Toggle ESP visibility for team members\n\n### Settings\n\n#### UI Customization\n- **Theme Selection**:\n  - Dark\n  - Light\n  - Midnight\n  - Ocean\n\n#### Keybinds\n- **Menu Toggle**: Customizable keybind options:\n  - RightShift (Default)\n  - LeftShift\n  - RightControl\n  - LeftControl\n  - RightAlt\n  - LeftAlt\n  - Tab\n  - CapsLock\n  - F1-F12\n  - Insert\n  - Delete\n  - Home\n  - End\n  - PageUp\n  - PageDown\n\n#### Performance Settings\n- **FPS Unlocker**: Toggle FPS unlock (cosmetic) (not working)\n- **FPS Cap**: Adjustable FPS limit (30-240 FPS) (not working)\n\n### Profile\n- Display user avatar\n- Display username\n- Display user ID\n- Logout button (cosmetic) (in progress/not done)\n\n## Notes\nIf things don't work don't dislike. join the discord server or add my discord to report the issue.","tags":["Universal aimbot","Universal","aimbot","esp","universal esp"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5","username":"Keptbyu","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1b05ddfb2e9d58fd4f5fa371bda6acbaf86ec08f1f037955ecf855c7efc4742c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5-1748960260050.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1b05ddfb2e9d58fd4f5fa371bda6acbaf86ec08f1f037955ecf855c7efc4742c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5-1748960260050.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T03:01:32.590Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6843408e343da7b997e24056","editBy":{"_id":"68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5","username":"Keptbyu","status":"offline","id":"68331ba00bf7ae215758cfb5"},"